#: data/maps/MauvilleCity_BikeShop/scripts.inc:179
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_BikeShop_Text_RydelGreeting"
msgid ""
"Well, well, what have we here?\n"
"A most energetic customer!\p"
"Me? You may call me RYDEL.\n"
"I'm the owner of this cycle shop.$"
msgstr ""
"哎呀哎呀，这是谁来了？\n"
"真是一位活力十足的客人！\p"
"我？你可以叫我风野。\n"
"我是这家自行车店的店长。$"

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity_BikeShop/scripts.inc:185
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_BikeShop_Text_DidYouComeFromFarAway"
msgid ""
"RYDEL: Your RUNNING SHOES…\n"
"They're awfully filthy.\p"
"Did you come from far away?$"
msgstr ""
"风野：你的跑步鞋……\n"
"脏得好厉害啊。\p"
"你是从很远的地方来的吗？$"

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity_BikeShop/scripts.inc:190
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_BikeShop_Text_GuessYouDontNeedBike"
msgid ""
"RYDEL: Is that right?\p"
"Then, I guess you have no need for\n"
"any of my BIKES.$"
msgstr ""
"风野：是吗？\p"
"那么，你大概不需要\n"
"我的自行车吧。$"

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity_BikeShop/scripts.inc:195
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_BikeShop_Text_ExplainBikesChooseWhichOne"
msgid ""
"RYDEL: Hm, hm… … … … …\p"
"You're saying that you came all this\n"
"way from LITTLEROOT?\p"
"My goodness!\n"
"That's ridiculously far!\p"
"If you had one of my BIKES, you could\n"
"go anywhere easily while feeling the\l"
"gentle caress of the wind!\p"
"I'll tell you what!\n"
"I'll give you a BIKE!\p"
"Oh, wait a second!\p"
"I forgot to tell you that there are\n"
"two kinds of BIKES!\p"
"They are the MACH BIKE and\n"
"the ACRO BIKE!\p"
"The MACH BIKE is for cyclists who want\n"
"to feel the wind with their bodies!\p"
"And an ACRO BIKE is for those who\n"
"prefer technical rides!\p"
"I'm a real sweetheart, so you can\n"
"have whichever one you like!\p"
"Which one will you choose?$"
msgstr ""
"风野：嗯，嗯…… …… ……\p"
"你是说你从未白镇\n"
"一路走到这里来的？\p"
"我的天哪！\n"
"那也太远了吧！\p"
"要是你有我的自行车，\n"
"就能一边感受微风的轻抚，\l"
"一边轻松去任何地方！\p"
"这样吧！\n"
"我送你一辆自行车！\p"
"啊，等一下！\p"
"我忘了告诉你，\n"
"自行车有两种！\p"
"分别是音速自行车\n"
"和越野自行车！\p"
"音速自行车适合想要\n"
"用全身感受风的人！\p"
"越野自行车则适合\n"
"喜欢技巧骑行的人！\p"
"我是个大好人，\n"
"所以你喜欢哪一辆都可以！\p"
"你要选哪一辆呢？$"

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity_BikeShop/scripts.inc:219
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_BikeShop_Text_ChoseMachBike"
msgid "{PLAYER} chose the MACH BIKE.$"
msgstr "{PLAYER}选择了音速自行车。$"

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity_BikeShop/scripts.inc:222
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_BikeShop_Text_ChoseAcroBike"
msgid "{PLAYER} chose the ACRO BIKE.$"
msgstr "{PLAYER}选择了越野自行车。$"

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity_BikeShop/scripts.inc:225
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_BikeShop_Text_ComeBackToSwitchBikes"
msgid ""
"RYDEL: If you get the urge to switch\n"
"BIKES, just come see me!$"
msgstr ""
"风野：如果你想换自行车，\n"
"随时来找我吧！$"

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity_BikeShop/scripts.inc:229
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_BikeShop_Text_WantToSwitchBikes"
msgid ""
"RYDEL: Oh? Were you thinking about\n"
"switching BIKES?$"
msgstr "风野：哦？你是想换自行车吗？$"

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity_BikeShop/scripts.inc:233
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_BikeShop_Text_IllSwitchBikes"
msgid ""
"RYDEL: Okay, no problem!\n"
"I'll switch BIKES for you!$"
msgstr ""
"风野：好的，没问题！\n"
"我帮你换！$"

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity_BikeShop/scripts.inc:237
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_BikeShop_Text_ExchangedMachForAcro"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER} got the MACH BIKE exchanged\n"
"for an ACRO BIKE.$"
msgstr ""
"{PLAYER}把音速自行车\n"
"换成了越野自行车。$"

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity_BikeShop/scripts.inc:241
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_BikeShop_Text_ExchangedAcroForMach"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER} got the ACRO BIKE exchanged\n"
"for a MACH BIKE.$"
msgstr ""
"{PLAYER}把越野自行车\n"
"换成了音速自行车。$"

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity_BikeShop/scripts.inc:245
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_BikeShop_Text_HappyYouLikeIt"
msgid ""
"RYDEL: Good, good!\n"
"I'm happy that you like it!$"
msgstr ""
"风野：好，好！\n"
"你喜欢就好！$"

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity_BikeShop/scripts.inc:249
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_BikeShop_Text_OhYourBikeIsInPC"
msgid ""
"Oh? What happened to that BIKE\n"
"I gave you?\p"
"Oh, I get it, you stored it using your PC.\p"
"Well, take it out of PC storage,\n"
"and I'll be happy to exchange it!\p"
"May the wind always be at your back\n"
"on your adventure!$"
msgstr ""
"哦？我给你的那辆自行车\n"
"怎么了？\p"
"啊，我明白了，\n"
"你用电脑把它存起来了。\p"
"那么，从电脑里把它取出来，\n"
"我很乐意帮你换！\p"
"祝你在冒险中\n"
"永远一路顺风！$"

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity_BikeShop/scripts.inc:258
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_BikeShop_Text_HandbooksAreInBack"
msgid ""
"I'm learning about BIKES while\n"
"I work here.\p"
"If you need advice on how to ride your\n"
"BIKE, there're a couple handbooks in\l"
"the back.$"
msgstr ""
"我一边在这里工作，\n"
"一边学习关于自行车的知识。\p"
"如果你想知道怎么骑自行车，\n"
"后面有几本手册可以看。$"

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity_BikeShop/scripts.inc:265
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_BikeShop_Text_MachHandbookWhichPage"
msgid ""
"It's a handbook on the MACH BIKE.\p"
"Which page do you want to read?$"
msgstr ""
"这是音速自行车的手册。\p"
"要看哪一页呢？$"

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity_BikeShop/scripts.inc:269
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_BikeShop_Text_HowToRideMachBike"
msgid ""
"A BIKE moves in the direction that\n"
"the + Control Pad is pressed.\p"
"It will speed up once it gets rolling.\p"
"To stop, release the + Control Pad.\n"
"The BIKE will slow to a stop.\p"
"Want to read a different page?$"
msgstr ""
"自行车会朝着按下\n"
"十字键的方向前进。\p"
"骑起来以后速度会越来越快。\p"
"想停下来的话，就松开十字键。\n"
"自行车会慢慢减速停下。\p"
"要看其他页吗？$"

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity_BikeShop/scripts.inc:277
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_BikeShop_Text_HowToTurnMachBike"
msgid ""
"A MACH BIKE is speedy, but it can't\n"
"stop very quickly.\p"
"It gets a little tricky to get around\n"
"a corner.\p"
"Release the + Control Pad a little\n"
"before the corner and slow down.\p"
"Want to read a different page?$"
msgstr ""
"音速自行车速度很快，\n"
"但是没办法马上停下来。\p"
"要转弯的时候\n"
"会有点困难。\p"
"在转弯前稍微松开十字键，\n"
"把速度降下来吧。\p"
"要看其他页吗？$"

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity_BikeShop/scripts.inc:286
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_BikeShop_Text_SandySlopes"
msgid ""
"There are small sandy slopes\n"
"throughout the HOENN region.\p"
"The loose, crumbly sand makes it\n"
"impossible to climb normally.\p"
"But if you have a MACH BIKE, you can\n"
"zip up a sandy slope.\p"
"Want to read a different page?$"
msgstr ""
"丰缘地区到处都有\n"
"小小的沙坡。\p"
"因为沙子很松软，\n"
"所以平常是爬不上去的。\p"
"不过，如果有音速自行车，\n"
"就能一口气冲上沙坡。\p"
"要看其他页吗？$"

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity_BikeShop/scripts.inc:295
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_BikeShop_Text_AcroHandbookWhichPage"
msgid ""
"It's a handbook on the ACRO BIKE.\p"
"Which page do you want to read?$"
msgstr ""
"这是越野自行车的手册。\p"
"要看哪一页呢？$"

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity_BikeShop/scripts.inc:299
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_BikeShop_Text_Wheelies"
msgid ""
"Press the B Button while riding,\n"
"and the front wheel lifts up.\p"
"You can zip around with the front\n"
"wheel up using the + Control Pad.\p"
"This technique is called a wheelie.\p"
"Want to read a different page?$"
msgstr ""
"骑车时按下B键，\n"
"前轮就会抬起来。\p"
"前轮抬起时，\n"
"也可以用十字键到处骑。\p"
"这个技巧叫作翘头。\p"
"要看其他页吗？$"

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity_BikeShop/scripts.inc:307
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_BikeShop_Text_BunnyHops"
msgid ""
"Keeping the B Button pressed,\n"
"your BIKE can hop on the spot.\p"
"This technique is called a bunny hop.\p"
"You can ride while hopping, too.\p"
"Want to read a different page?$"
msgstr ""
"按住B键不放，\n"
"自行车就能在原地跳跃。\p"
"这个技巧叫作兔子跳。\p"
"也可以一边跳一边骑。\p"
"要看其他页吗？$"

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity_BikeShop/scripts.inc:314
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_BikeShop_Text_Jumps"
msgid ""
"Press the B Button and the + Control\n"
"Pad at the same time to jump.\p"
"Press the + Control Pad to the side\n"
"to jump sideways.\p"
"Press it backwards to make the BIKE\n"
"change directions while jumping.\p"
"Want to read a different page?$"
msgstr ""
"同时按下B键和十字键\n"
"就能跳起来。\p"
"按十字键的左右方向，\n"
"就能横向跳跃。\p"
"按十字键的反方向，\n"
"就能在跳跃时改变自行车的方向。\p"
"要看其他页吗？$"
